                                "sense_id": "39be2978-2ad0-3147-8983-0d3def61e4f6",
                                "text": "1957, Manny Farber, \"Underground Films\", in Robert Walsh (ed.) Negative Space: Manny Farber on the movies (1998), p. 27,\nThe excess that is so noticeable in Stevens's brawl is absent in the least serious undergrounder, […]"
                            },
